flowchart TD
    U[Student / Advisor question] --> R{Need validated academic data?}

    R -->|No, general advice| B[Baseline Chatbot Path]
    B --> BF[Answer general study guidance]

    R -->|Yes| G{Guardrail scope check}
    G -->|Missing profile info| Q[Ask for student id, completed courses, goal, credit limit]
    G -->|Out of academic scope| O[Refuse briefly and redirect to academic advising]
    G -->|In scope| A[ReAct Agent Path]

    A --> T{Choose tool}
    T --> C[get_student_context]
    T --> S[search_courses]
    T --> P[check_prerequisites]
    T --> W[estimate_workload]
    T --> PL[generate_study_plan / simulate_what_if]
    T --> SUB[submit_plan]
    T --> REV[review_plan]

    C --> OBS[Observation from validated backend data]
    S --> OBS
    P --> OBS
    W --> OBS
    PL --> OBS
    SUB --> OBS
    REV --> OBS

    OBS --> OK{Observation ok?}
    OK -->|No| SAFE[Explain error, do not invent course/plan]
    OK -->|Yes| F[Final Answer with reasons, warnings, next action]

    PL --> DRAFT[Plan status: draft]
    DRAFT --> SUBMIT[Student submits plan]
    SUBMIT --> PENDING[Plan status: pending_approval]
    PENDING --> DECIDE{Advisor decision}
    DECIDE --> APPROVED[approved]
    DECIDE --> REJECTED[rejected]
